msgid "@george1 Miss Silverpoint! \\.\\.You've returned!"
msgstr "@george1 シルバーポイントさん！\\.\\.戻ってこられたのね！！"

msgid "@george1_hm AHA! George sees that you have found the messiah!"
msgstr "@george1_hm あら！ジョージには全てお見通しよ。\nようやく救世主を見つけたのね！"

msgid "@kip_sigh ...yeah."
msgstr "@kip_sigh …ええ。"

msgid "@kip_pout ...we ran into each other after this boy forced himself into the lab complex..."
msgstr "@kip_pout …さっきの子が研究所に入り込んでしまった\nあと、たまたま救世主とも遭遇したの…"

msgid "@george2_grr Well well well, look who's back!"
msgstr "@george2_grr あらあらあら、\n誰が帰ってきたのかと思ったら！"

msgid "@george2_no How about next time you LET ME KNOW BEFORE YOU LEAVE THE SHELTER TO GO INTO A LITERAL DEATH ZONE!"
msgstr "@george2_no 次からは、自殺しにいくときはアタシに\n一報くれると助かるんだけどね！！"

msgid "@kip_heh Sorry..."
msgstr "@kip_heh ごめん…"

msgid "@george2_sigh I get so worried, y'know..."
msgstr "@george2_sigh ったく、無駄に心配させて…"

msgid "@george2 ....\\.\\.Hey! You found the messiah!"
msgstr "@george2 …\\.\\.そんなことより！救世主を見つけたのね！"

msgid "@george3_sad ...Kip. \\.\\.You made it back..."
msgstr "@george3_sad …キップ… \\.\\.帰ってこられたのね…"

msgid "@george3_sigh I was so worried...."
msgstr "@george3_sigh 本当に心配した…"

msgid "@george3_worry ...um...."
msgstr "@george3_worry …え…"

msgid "@george3_worry ...I see...\\.\\. I see you've found the messiah..."
msgstr "@george3_worry …そう…\\.\\.救世主を見つけたのね…"

msgid "@george4 Kip! \\.\\.You're alive!"
msgstr "@george4 キップ！ \\.\\.生きてたんだ！"

msgid "@george4_oops You...\\.\\. um, should really tell me before you leave next time..."
msgstr "@george4_oops えと…\\.\\.、次にどっか行く時は\nちゃんと教えてね…"

msgid "@george4_smile It's fine!"
msgstr "@george4_smile いいのいいの！"

msgid "@george4_omg Oh my gosh... you found the messiah too?"
msgstr "@george4_omg わわ…救世主まで見つけてきたの？"

msgid "@george5 Hello, Miss Silverpoint! \\.\\.I'm glad you've made it back safely."
msgstr "@george5 まあ、シルバーポイントさん！ \\.\\.無事に戻ってきてくれて良かったわ。"

msgid "@george5_sigh Gosh... you should have told me where you were going!"
msgstr "@george5_sigh 全くもう…どこに行くかぐらい、\n教えてくれればよかったのに！"

msgid "@kip_heh Sorry, George..."
msgstr "@kip_heh ごめんね、ジョージ…"

msgid "@george5 I... see you also found the messiah!"
msgstr "@george5 それで…救世主さんを見つけてきたのね！"

msgid "@george5_smile Hello, little one!"
msgstr "@george5_smile こんばんは、おちびさん！"

msgid "@niko Hi..."
msgstr "@niko こんばんは…"

msgid "@kip_sigh ...we...\\.\\. ran into each other after this boy forced himself into the lab complex..."
msgstr "@kip_sigh さっきの子が…\\.\\. 研究所に入り込んでしまった\nあと、救世主ともたまたま遭遇したの…"

msgid "@george6_point Eyy Kip! \\.\\.You made it back in one piece!"
msgstr "@george6_point イエーーーイキップ！ \\.\\.何とか\n死なずに帰ってこれたじゃーん！"

msgid "@george6_shrug Ya kinda left the shelter without tellin' me...\\>\\nSure gave me a good scare back there!"
msgstr "@george6_shrug ウチに何も言わず出てくなんてさー…\\>\\nマジ、超ヒヤヒヤしたわ！"

msgid "@george6 Whoaa! You found the messiah too?"
msgstr "@george6 ワーーオ！救世主クン見つけちゃったの？"

msgid "@george6_fingerguns Sweeet."
msgstr "@george6_fingerguns やっぱ、アンタってハンパないわ。"

msgid "@george6_point How's it goin', lil fella?"
msgstr "@george6_point チビくん、元気してるー？"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed Bad."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed ううん。"

msgid "@george6_shrug Oh same."
msgstr "@george6_shrug ウチとイッショじゃーん。"

msgid "@kip_pout ...we, um."
msgstr "@kip_pout …あの、ね。"

msgid "@kip_sigh ...we ran into each other after this boy forced himself into the lab complex..."
msgstr "@kip_sigh …さっきの子が研究所に入り込んでしまった\nあと、たまたま救世主とも遭遇したの…"

msgid "@kip_sad I...\\.\\. couldn't stop him..."
msgstr "@kip_sad あの子を…\\.\\. 止められなかった…"

msgid "@kip_pout I don't know why he was being so insistent!"
msgstr "@kip_pout どうしてあそこまで必死だったのか、\n理解できないわ！"

msgid "@niko4 He... \\.\\.he said he needed to go rebuild a robot..."
msgstr "@niko4 セドリック… \\.\\.ロボットをもう一度\n作らなきゃって、言ってたよ…"

msgid "@kip_pout Oh, you know him?"
msgstr "@kip_pout あら、あの子のこと知ってるの？"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed Yeah."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed うん。"

msgid "@george1_hm AHA! Building a robot!"
msgstr "@george1_hm なるほど！ロボットね！"

msgid "@george1 So THAT's what he needed that book for!"
msgstr "@george1 あの本を必要としていたのは、\nそういうこと！"

msgid "@niko2 ...come again?"
msgstr "@niko2 …どういうこと？"

msgid "@george1 A boy with white hair and goggles ran in here not long ago."
msgstr "@george1 白髪の、ゴーグルを着けた男の子が\n先ほどここに飛び込んできたの。"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed That's Cedric, yeah..."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed それ、セドリックだね…"

msgid "@george1 He grabbed one of the books from my (very impressive) archives upstairs and bolted straight out."
msgstr "@george1 その子が、2階にある私の（驚くほど素晴らしい）\n収蔵庫から本を1冊取り出して、\nどこかへ行ってしまったの。"

msgid "@george1_smile Said it was an emergency so George let it slide."
msgstr "@george1_smile 緊急事態と言っていたから、\nこのジョージは見逃してあげたのよ。"

msgid "@george1 George hopes he's okay..."
msgstr "@george1 無事かしら…"

msgid "@george2_grr Robot..."
msgstr "@george2_grr ロボット、か…"

msgid "@george2_sigh That's why he needed that book so badly..."
msgstr "@george2_sigh だから、あの本がバカみたいに\n必要だったのね…"

msgid "@george2 Y'all talking about a kid with white hair and goggles?"
msgstr "@george2 そいつって、アレでしょ。\n白い髪をしてて、ゴーグルを頭に\n着けた男の子のことでしょ？"

msgid "@niko2 That's Cedric, yeah..."
msgstr "@niko2 うん、セドリックだね…"

msgid "@george2_stress He ran in here earlier, grabbed one of the books from my archives, and ran straight out the door."
msgstr "@george2_stress ここに飛び込んできたと思ったら、\nアタシの収蔵庫から1冊持って\nどっか行っちゃったのよ。"

msgid "@george2_stress ...without even going through checkout!"
msgstr "@george2_stress …貸出手続きもせずに！"

msgid "@george2_no THE NERVE OF THAT KID!"
msgstr "@george2_no 大した度胸じゃない！！！"

msgid "@niko4 Um..."
msgstr "@niko4 あの…"

msgid "@george2_grr Said it was an emergency, so I didn't bother stopping him."
msgstr "@george2_grr 緊急事態だって言うから、止めなかったわ。"

msgid "@george2_sigh I... hope he doesn't get himself killed out there."
msgstr "@george2_sigh はー…あそこで死んでなきゃいいけど。"

msgid "@george3 ...robot..."
msgstr "@george3 …ロボット…"

msgid "@george3 Are you talking about...\\.\\. a boy with white hair and googles?"
msgstr "@george3 それって…\\.\\. 白い髪をしていて、\n頭にゴーグルを着けている男の子のこと…？"

msgid "@george3 He..."
msgstr "@george3 彼…"

msgid "@george3 He said he really needed a book from the backroom and said it was an emergency and I let him have it and he ran out and..."
msgstr "@george3 奥の部屋にある本がどうしても\n必要で、緊急だと言うものだから…\n渡したらすぐさま出て行ってしまって…"

msgid "@george3_sigh Oh.... I should have stopped him...."
msgstr "@george3_sigh はぁ… 止めておくべきだった…"

msgid "@george3_worry I hope he's...\\.\\. okay..."
msgstr "@george3_worry 彼…\\.\\.無事だといいけど…"

msgid "@george4_golly A robot!"
msgstr "@george4_golly ロボット！"

msgid "@george4_golly ...no wonder why he needed that book!"
msgstr "@george4_golly …だからあの本が必要だったのかー！"

msgid "@george4 We are talking about the same boy, right?"
msgstr "@george4 あれれ、あの男の子のことでしょ？"

msgid "@george4_golly Hat... white hair... goggles..."
msgstr "@george4_golly 帽子かぶってて…白髪で…\nあと、ゴーグルも…"

msgid "@george4_golly He, um..."
msgstr "@george4_golly カレね…その…"

msgid "@george4 He grabbed a book from the back room and then just bolted straight out!"
msgstr "@george4 奥の部屋から本を1冊持って、\nさっさと出て行っちゃった！"

msgid "@george4_oops He said it was an emergency, so I didn't try to stop him..."
msgstr "@george4_oops 緊急事態だーって言うから、\n止めなかったんだ…"

msgid "@george4_golly Gosh... I hope he's okay..."
msgstr "@george4_golly そっかー… 無事だといいんだけどね…"

msgid "@george5 Building a robot, you say?"
msgstr "@george5 ロボットを作る、ですって？"

msgid "@george5 Could that be... why he needed that book?"
msgstr "@george5 それが…あの本を\n必要としていた理由なの？"

msgid "@george5 Ah... a young man with white hair and green glasses ran in earlier."
msgstr "@george5 そのね…少し前に、緑のメガネを着けた、\n白い髪の男の子が慌ててやってきたの。"

msgid "@george5 He said he really needed a book from the backroom... said it was an emergency, too!"
msgstr "@george5 奥の部屋にある本がどうしても必要って…\n緊急事態だとも言っていたわ！"

msgid "@george5_hmm Poor darling looked so stressed out... so I just gave him the book..."
msgstr "@george5_hmm 本当に必死な様子で、何だか可哀想で…\nだから、その本は渡してあげたの…"

msgid "@george5 I hope he is safe..."
msgstr "@george5 無事だといいのだけれど…"

msgid "@george6 Robot, eh?"
msgstr "@george6 ん、ロボットっつった？"

msgid "@george6 Y'all talkin' about a lil' dude with white hair and goggles, right?"
msgstr "@george6 それってアレっしょ、白髪＆ゴーグルの\nチビガキのことっしょ？"

msgid "@niko4 That's Cedric, yeah..."
msgstr "@niko4 うん、セドリックだね…"

msgid "@george6 Bruh ran off with one of my books!"
msgstr "@george6 そいつなら、ウチの本1冊担いで\nどっかにブッ飛んでったけど！"

msgid "@george6_shrug Said it was an emergency, so I just let 'im have it."
msgstr "@george6_shrug 緊急っつーからさ、持ってかせたのよ。"

msgid "@george6 Hope he didn't run into trouble, dude..."
msgstr "@george6 ヤバイことになってなきゃいいけど…"

msgid "@kip_sigh Yeah... I hope he's alright, too..."
msgstr "@kip_sigh ええ…本当に、無事だといいわね…"

msgid "@kip_pout With any luck, maybe the lab complex can hold up long enough for him to..."
msgstr "@kip_pout 運が良ければ、研究所がギリギリ\nもってくれるかもしれないわ…"

msgid "@kip_worry Oh my gosh.... \\>It..."
msgstr "@kip_worry ウソでしょ… \\>あれ…"

msgid "@kip_worry That was..."
msgstr "@kip_worry あれって、もしかして…"

msgid "@niko3 ...the labs?"
msgstr "@niko3 …研究所？"

msgid "@kip_worry That poor kid!!!"
msgstr "@kip_worry あのバカ！！！"

msgid "@niko_shock No!!!"
msgstr "@niko_shock そんな！！！"

msgid "@niko_distressed_meow Not him too!!!!"
msgstr "@niko_distressed_meow セドリックまで！！！"

msgid "@kip_sad I'm..."
msgstr "@kip_sad あいつ…"

msgid "@kip_sigh I'm sorry about your friend..."
msgstr "@kip_sigh あなたのお友達、残念だったわね…"

msgid "@niko_distressed2 ..."
msgstr "@niko_distressed2 …"

msgid "@niko_distressed ...the last time we spoke, he told me to go look for someone on the surface."
msgstr "@niko_distressed …地上に着いたらすぐに誰かを探してって、\nセドリックは最後に…"

msgid "@niko4 I... \\.\\.I need to get going."
msgstr "@niko4 ミー… \\.\\.行かなきゃ。"

msgid "@george1 George... \\.\\.\\@george1_hm WON'T let you go out there!"
msgstr "@george1 それは無理ね… \\.\\.\\@george1_hm この私が許さないわ！"

msgid "@george1_hm The messiah will not walk into danger on my watch!"
msgstr "@george1_hm この私がいる限り、救世主を危険に\n晒すようなことはあってはならない！"

msgid "@niko3 But..."
msgstr "@niko3 でも…"

msgid "@george2_stress Are you KIDDING ME??"
msgstr "@george2_stress バカじゃないの？？"

msgid "@george2_grr Kid, there is NO way we're letting you out there."
msgstr "@george2_grr チビすけ、アンタをあんな\n危険な場所には行かせないわよ。"

msgid "@niko3 But I really have to..."
msgstr "@niko3 でも、どうしても行かなきゃ…"

msgid "@george3_worry Um...\\.\\. um..."
msgstr "@george3_worry え…そんな\\.\\.…"

msgid "@george3_cry You...\\.\\. shouldn't go out there....!"
msgstr "@george3_cry あそこには…\\.\\. 行ってはだめよ…！"

msgid "@niko_distressed But..."
msgstr "@niko_distressed でも…"

msgid "@george3_worry Oh.... \\.\\.help me out here, Kip...."
msgstr "@george3_worry ああ… \\.\\.何とか言ってちょうだい…キップ…"

msgid "@george4 ...messiah, please."
msgstr "@george4 …救世主クン、それはダメ。"

msgid "@george4_golly We don't... want you to go out there."
msgstr "@george4_golly キミを…危ないとこには連れていけない。"

msgid "@george4_golly Not when everything is... \\.\\.well..."
msgstr "@george4_golly 特に今は… \\.\\.ね…"

msgid "@george5_hmm Sweetie, you know we can't let you just walk into danger!"
msgstr "@george5_hmm おちびさん、貴方を危ない目には\nあわせられないわ！"

msgid "@george6 Bruh...\\>\\n\\@george6_point You know we ain't gonna let you walk into the fire like that!"
msgstr "@george6 チビくーん…\\>\\n\\@george6_point ウチらが、Youをあんな火の中に\n突っ込ませるワケないっしょ！"

msgid "@george6_shrug Fire... squares..."
msgstr "@george6_shrug 火…アーンド四角形…"

msgid "@niko4 But..."
msgstr "@niko4 でも…"

msgid "@kip_sigh George is right..."
msgstr "@kip_sigh ジョージの言う通りよ…"

msgid "@kip_pout The squares seem to be targeting a lot of the weaker constructs in the city."
msgstr "@kip_pout 四角形はね、街にある強度の弱い\n建物を標的にしてるみたいなの。"

msgid "@kip_sigh Only the library has enough structural integrity to withstand collapse..."
msgstr "@kip_sigh 図書館だけなのよ。崩壊に耐えられるだけの\n強度を備えているのは…"

msgid "@kip_sad It's... best if you stayed here until things stabilize."
msgstr "@kip_sad だから…状態がもう少し安定するまで、\nここにいた方がいい。"

msgid "@kip_sigh ...however long that takes."
msgstr "@kip_sigh …その安定に、どれだけ時間がかかってもね。"

msgid "@niko2 But....\\.\\. \\@niko4 but..."
msgstr "@niko2 でも…\\.\\.\\@niko4 そしたら…"

msgid "@niko2 What about...\\.\\. my mission?"
msgstr "@niko2 ミーの…\\.\\. 使命はどうなっちゃうの…？"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed Don't you guys want me to bring the sun back, at least?"
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed 太陽を取り戻したくないの？"

msgid "@george1 Even if you do restore the sun, the squares will persist..."
msgstr "@george1 たとえ太陽を元に戻したとしても、\n四角形は存在し続けるわ…"

msgid "@george2_sigh The sun won't do us any good if the squares are just gonna mess everything up."
msgstr "@george2_sigh どうせ四角形がまた全部めちゃくちゃに\nするんだから、太陽なんてあっても\n意味ないわよ。"

msgid "@george3_worry Oh...\\.\\. but even if you do bring the sun back..."
msgstr "@george3_worry はぁ…\\.\\.でも、もし太陽を\n取り戻したとしても…"

msgid "@george3_sigh ...the squares... they'll still be here..."
msgstr "@george3_sigh …四角形は…なくならないのよ…"

msgid "@george4_golly Even if you do bring back the sun, that's not gonna fix the squares..."
msgstr "@george4_golly 太陽を取り戻しても、四角形が\nなくなるとは思えないなー…"

msgid "@george5 Even if you do restore the sun, I'm not sure that'll fix the squares..."
msgstr "@george5 太陽が元に戻ったとしてもね、四角形が\nなくなる保証はどこにもないの…"

msgid "@george6_shrug ...sun ain't gonna make the squares go away, dude."
msgstr "@george6_shrug …太陽があってもさ、四角形は\n消えないんだわ、チビくん。"

msgid "@kip_sigh Sadly..."
msgstr "@kip_sigh そうね…"

msgid "@kip_sad Not to mention... even getting there is going to be hard..."
msgstr "@kip_sad 分かってると思うけど…あそこに\n辿り着くだけでも一苦労なのよ…"

msgid "@kip_pout If the world is like this... there's no telling what's going on in the Tower!"
msgstr "@kip_pout 世界がこんなことになっている今…塔で何が\n起こっているかなんて誰にも分からない！"

msgid "@george1_hm And... if anything bad happened to the messiah, of all people..."
msgstr "@george1_hm それに…もし救世主の身に\n何か起きてしまったら…"

msgid "@george1 ...George doesn't want to think about it."
msgstr "@george1 …そんなこと、このジョージは\n想像もしたくないわ。"

msgid "@george2_stress And... if anything bad happened to the messiah, of all people..."
msgstr "@george2_stress しかも…アタシたちの\n救世主の身に何か起きたら…"

msgid "@george2_no ...NO!!! I won't allow it!!!"
msgstr "@george2_no …あり得ないわ！！！\nそんなの、アタシが許すわけない！！！"

msgid "@george3_sad And... if anything bad happened to the messiah, of all people..."
msgstr "@george3_sad しかも…私たちの\n救世主の身に何か起きてしまったら…"

msgid "@george3_sigh I'm not sure if I'll be able forgive myself..."
msgstr "@george3_sigh 私は…絶対に自分を許すことができない…"

msgid "@george4_golly And... if anything bad happened to the messiah, of all people..."
msgstr "@george4_golly それにさ…私たちの救世主クンの身に\n何か起きちゃったら…"

msgid "@george4 I'm not sure what we'd do!"
msgstr "@george4 わたし、どうしたらいいか\n分からなくなっちゃう！"

msgid "@george5_hmm And... if anything bad happened to the messiah, of all people..."
msgstr "@george5_hmm それに…もし私たちのおちびさんの身に\n何か起きたら…"

msgid "@george5_sigh Oh... that would be so dreadful, dear..."
msgstr "@george5_sigh ああ…考えるだけでも恐ろしい…"

msgid "@george6 And... if the messiah got hurt, of all people..."
msgstr "@george6 つーか…万が一ウチらのチビくんが\n怪我なんかしたら…"

msgid "@george6_shrug That's like...\\.\\. the exact opposite of radical, dude...."
msgstr "@george6_shrug もう、アレよ…\\.\\.超ヤバいっしょ…"

msgid "@kip_sigh Sigh..."
msgstr "@kip_sigh はぁ…"

msgid "@kip_sad A friend of mine... said something about this forever ago..."
msgstr "@kip_sad 私の友達がね…\nずっと前に、言ってたことなんだけど…"

msgid "@kip_pout \"It's better for the world to die naturally.\""
msgstr "@kip_pout 「世界は自然に死なせるべき」"

msgid "@kip_sigh \"No living being should have to carry that burden.\""
msgstr "@kip_sigh 「どんな生き物であれ、\nそんな重荷を抱えるべきではない」"

msgid "@kip_sad At the time... I thought it was still her faulty code speaking..."
msgstr "@kip_sad その時は…バグコードの影響で\nそう言ったんだと思ってた…"

msgid "@kip_sigh But now I... \\.\\.I'm starting to understand..."
msgstr "@kip_sigh でも今なら… \\.\\.\n分かるような気がする…"

msgid "@niko4 ..."
msgstr "@niko4 …"

msgid "@kip_pout Messiah... \\.\\.I'm sorry..."
msgstr "@kip_pout 救世主… \\.\\.ごめんなさい…"

msgid "@kip_sad I'm really, really sorry...."
msgstr "@kip_sad 本当に、本当にごめんなさい…"

msgid "@kip_sigh All this time, we've burdened you with our hope, our faith..."
msgstr "@kip_sigh ずっと、みんなの希望と信頼を\nあなたに背負わせてしまってた…"

msgid "@kip_pout ...blissfully ignoring the fact that you are just a lost child."
msgstr "@kip_pout …あなたがこの世界に迷い込んできた子供\nだっていうことを、都合よく無視して。"

msgid "@niko3 Well..."
msgstr "@niko3 あの…"

msgid "@kip_pout You're probably more scared than any of us, aren't you?"
msgstr "@kip_pout 誰よりも一番怖いと\n感じているのは、あなたよね。"

msgid "@kip_pout We... have been dealing with tragedy for so long, it's become background noise to us now."
msgstr "@kip_pout 私たちは…この悲惨な状況にずっと\n晒されてきたせいで、もう何も\n感じなくなってしまったの。"

msgid "@kip_sad But for you... \\.\\.it must be so terrifying..."
msgstr "@kip_sad でも、あなたにとっては… \\.\\.すごく恐ろしいはずよね…"

msgid "@kip_sad And now, you're stuck here with the rest of us..."
msgstr "@kip_sad それに今、私たちと同じように\nここに閉じ込められてしまってる…"

msgid "@kip_pout ...being held back by the very people you were told to save."
msgstr "@kip_pout …この世界を救ってくれと頼んできた\n人たちに、今度は引き止められている。"

msgid "@kip_sigh We must seem so ungrateful..."
msgstr "@kip_sigh 私たち、どんだけ恩知らずなのよ…"

msgid "@niko3 ..."
msgstr "@niko3 …"

msgid "@niko_distressed .....It's...\\> \\@niko_eyeclosed2 .....okay."
msgstr "@niko_distressed ……そんなの…\\>\\@niko_eyeclosed2 …気にしないで。"

msgid "@kip_pout ..."
msgstr "@kip_pout …"

msgid "@niko3 I..."
msgstr "@niko3 ミーは…"

msgid "@niko3 ...when I first came to this world... \\.\\.\\@niko4 a long time ago...."
msgstr "@niko3 …初めてこの世界に来た時にね… \\.\\.\\@niko4 ずっと前のことだけど…"

msgid "@niko_distressed2 ...back then, all I wanted was to go home."
msgstr "@niko_distressed2 …あの時は、早く家に帰りたいって\nずっと思ってたんだ。"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed ...\\p... do you remember?"
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed …\\p… 覚えてる？"

msgid "@niko2 The very FIRST time..."
msgstr "@niko2 本当に最初のころ…"

msgid "@niko5 I'm not sure how far back it was for you..."
msgstr "@niko5 神様にはどのくらい前のことなのか\n分かんないけど…"

msgid "@niko But... I remember towards the end...\\>\\n\\@niko_eyeclosed I... actually wasn't sure anymore."
msgstr "@niko でも…旅をしていくうちにね…\\>\\n\\@niko_eyeclosed その…よく分かんなくなっちゃったんだ。"

msgid "@niko_upset ...about going home."
msgstr "@niko_upset …どうして家に帰りたいんだろうって。"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed Even knowing the world would be doomed eventually..."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed この世界がもうすぐ崩壊しちゃうって\n分かってても…"

msgid "@niko_distressed2 I... still wanted the people here to be happy..."
msgstr "@niko_distressed2 ミーは…みんなに\n幸せになってほしかった…"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed So...\\.\\. when you told me to return the sun, back then..."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed だから…\\.\\. 太陽を戻してって言われた時も…"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed I didn't even....\\.\\. question it..."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed 全然…\\.\\. なんで？って\n思わなかった…"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed So...\\.\\. when you told me to return home, back then..."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed だから…\\.\\. 家に帰れって言われた時…"

msgid "@niko_distressed2 I wasn't... \\.\\.sure..."
msgstr "@niko_distressed2 何だか… \\.\\.よく分からなくなって…"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed But I trusted you more, \\p..."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed けど、 \\p のこと、すごく\n信じてたから…"

msgid "@niko4 ...but then I just... came back."
msgstr "@niko4 …でも、そしたら…戻ってきちゃった。"

msgid "@kip_pout You... what..."
msgstr "@kip_pout あなた…何を言って…"

msgid "@niko3 And I... went through that decision again, didn't I?"
msgstr "@niko3 それでミーは…また、\nどうしたいか決めて、頑張ったでしょ？"

msgid "@niko_upset But...\\.\\. I came back again..."
msgstr "@niko_upset なのに…\\.\\. また戻ってきて…"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed Even though you were able to do both... \\.\\.the effects couldn't be permanent, could it?"
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed どっちも選べたとしても… \\.\\.その効果がずっと\n続くわけじゃないんでしょ？"

msgid "@niko_upset And then...\\.\\. I found out about the world being like this..."
msgstr "@niko_upset その後…\\.\\. 世界がこんなふうになってることを\n知ったんだ…"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed Sigh..."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed はぁ…"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed Prototype said to forget the things he told me... \\>\\nAnd Cedric told me not to think about it too much, but..."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed 話したことは忘れて、ってプロトタイプは\n言ってたし… \\>\\nセドリックも、あんまり気にしちゃダメって\n言ってたけど…"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed I..."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed でも…"

msgid "@niko4 I'm sorry for getting upset at you... back at the mines..."
msgstr "@niko4 神様に当たっちゃって、ごめんなさい…\n鉱山にいた時…"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed ...I thought... for you to know all that, yet continue doing this..."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed …神様がね…何もかも知ってて、それでも\nこういうことを続けてるのが…"

msgid "@niko_upset2 It... just seemed cruel."
msgstr "@niko_upset2 すごく…残酷に思えたんだ。"

msgid "@niko2 But then, I realized something..."
msgstr "@niko2 でもそしたら、気づいたんだ…"

msgid "@niko4 You... really wanted to save both the world and me..."
msgstr "@niko4 神様…本当は世界とミーを、両方とも\n救おうとしてくれてたんだね…"

msgid "@niko_distressed But at the end, you can only choose one, right?"
msgstr "@niko_distressed でも最後は、どっちかしか\n選べないんでしょ？"

msgid "@niko_distressed_talk Is it... really hard for you too?"
msgstr "@niko_distressed_talk そんなの…神様だって、つらいよね？"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed It must be..."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed きっとそうだよね…"

msgid "@niko3 ...\\.\\.if the world isn't broken...\\.\\. will that choice still be there?"
msgstr "@niko3 …\\.\\.世界が壊れてなくても…\n\\.\\.選ばなきゃいけないのかな？"

msgid "@niko4 ...do you...\\.\\. still need to choose between one or the other?"
msgstr "@niko4 …それでも…\\.\\. どっちかを、選ばなきゃ\nいけないのかな？"

msgid "@niko_sad But... even if it is..."
msgstr "@niko_sad でも…もし、そうでも…"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed I... \\.\\.really want to save this world, \\p."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed ミーは… \\.\\.この世界を\n救いたいよ、 \\p…"

msgid "@niko_distressed2 Even if it's more dangerous this time around..."
msgstr "@niko_distressed2 今回の旅が、どんなに危険でも…"

msgid "@niko_distressed_talk Even if... so many of the nice people we met were.... \\>\\@niko_distressed_meow were..."
msgstr "@niko_distressed_talk どんなに…今まで会った人たちが、もう… \\>\\@niko_distressed_meow もう…"

msgid "@niko_sad ......"
msgstr "@niko_sad ……"

msgid "@niko_distressed_talk \\p.... \\>\\n\\@niko_less_sad I'm not.... \\.\\.afraid, anymore...."
msgstr "@niko_distressed_talk \\p… \\>\\n\\@niko_less_sad ミーは… \\.\\.もう、怖くなんかないよ…"

msgid "@niko_cry *sniff*"
msgstr "@niko_cry ぐすん…"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed That's why...\\>\\n\\@niko3 I think you guys should let me go..."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed だから…\\>\\n\\@niko3 ミーを行かせてほしい…"

msgid "@niko_distressed2 I... promise I'll be okay..."
msgstr "@niko_distressed2 絶対に…大丈夫だから…"

msgid "@niko_distressed ...please?"
msgstr "@niko_distressed …ダメかな？"

msgid "@george1 ..."
msgstr "@george1 …"

msgid "@george1_hm George has heard your conversation with \\p and is deeply moved!"
msgstr "@george1_hm 今の \\p との会話を聞いて、\n本当に感激したわ！"

msgid "@george1_smug That's why... George has full faith in you!"
msgstr "@george1_smug そうね…私、あなたを全面的に信頼するわ！"

msgid "@george2_grr ...well, I'm convinced."
msgstr "@george2_grr …はぁ、分かった分かった。"

msgid "@george2 After all that...\\.\\. it'd be SUPER rude for me to stop you, wouldn't it?"
msgstr "@george2 今のを聞いて…\\.\\. アンタを止めると思う？"

msgid "@george3_sigh ...if you must..."
msgstr "@george3_sigh …そこまで言うなら…"

msgid "@george3_sad It... wouldn't be right for me to keep you..."
msgstr "@george3_sad 引き止めるのは…良くないよね…"

msgid "@george4_golly Ohhhh..... \\>\\n\\@george4_omg That was BEAUTIFUL!!!"
msgstr "@george4_golly うわわ……\\>\\n\\@george4_omg もう、サイコー！！！"

msgid "@george4_omg Kip!!! Did you hear that! The messiah was trying to encourage \\p!"
msgstr "@george4_omg キップ！！今の聞いた！？救世主が\n\\p を励まそうと！"

msgid "@kip_heh I'm right here..."
msgstr "@kip_heh いや、私ずっとここに…"

msgid "@george4_omg I KNOW RIGHT!!! IT HAPPENED RIGHT IN FRONT OF OUR EYES!!!"
msgstr "@george4_omg そう！！！\nわたしたちの！まさに！目の前で！こんな！！！"

msgid "@niko_speak ..."
msgstr "@niko_speak …"

msgid "@george4_oops ...sorry, got carried away..."
msgstr "@george4_oops …ごめん、テンション上がっちゃった…"

msgid "@george4 ...but yes, I think it's only right that we let you go!"
msgstr "@george4 …でも、うん。ここでキミを行かせなきゃ\nあとで後悔しちゃうね！"

msgid "@george5_sad Aww... sweetie..."
msgstr "@george5_sad まあ…貴方って子は…"

msgid "@george5_sigh You are so brave...\\.\\. even braver than most grown-ups..."
msgstr "@george5_sigh 本当に、勇敢なのね…\\.\\. 大人たちよりも\nずっと勇気がある…"

msgid "@george5_hmm It... wouldn't be right for us to keep you, would it?"
msgstr "@george5_hmm そんな…貴方を引き止めるなんて、無理な話。"

msgid "@george5_aww Besides, how can I say no to those puppy-dog eyes!"
msgstr "@george5_aww それに、そんな子犬のような目で\n見つめられたら、断れっこないわ！"

msgid "@george6_point Yo, kid...."
msgstr "@george6_point ねー、チビくん…"

msgid "@george6_smile You're real strong, you know that?"
msgstr "@george6_smile You、マジ最強だわ。自覚ないっしょ？"

msgid "@niko4 I..."
msgstr "@niko4 えっと…"

msgid "@george6_fingerguns Go knock 'em dead, tiger!"
msgstr "@george6_fingerguns バーンと決めちゃいな！"

msgid "@kip_heh Well, if George is fine with it..."
msgstr "@kip_heh まあ、ジョージがそう言うなら…"

msgid "@kip_sigh I... \\.\\.guess we should let you go now, messiah..."
msgstr "@kip_sigh そうね… \\.\\.行ってきなさい、救世主…"

msgid "@kip_pout But... promise us you'll be careful, okay?"
msgstr "@kip_pout でも…必ず気をつけてね、約束よ？"

msgid "@niko Mhm!"
msgstr "@niko うん！"

msgid "@niko2 You guys be safe too..."
msgstr "@niko2 みんなも元気でいてね…"

msgid "Oh! You're not injured, are you?"
msgstr "あっ！怪我はしてないよね？"

msgid "The head librarian has converted her room into an infirmary for now..."
msgstr "図書館長の部屋は、今は医務室として使われてるから…"

msgid "If you need a place to rest, let me know."
msgstr "休みたかったら、遠慮なく言ってね。"

msgid "Or... let her know, I guess!"
msgstr "それか…図書館長に、ね！"

msgid "We're still waiting on another group of evacuees..."
msgstr "まだ、他の避難者さんたちを待ってるの…"

msgid "One of the apartments on the other side of town got REALLY messed up yesterday..."
msgstr "昨日ね、街の向こう側にあるアパートが\n大変なことになっちゃって…"

msgid "Oh, hello!"
msgstr "あっ、こんばんは！"

msgid "The library is currently being used as a shelter right now."
msgstr "図書館は今、避難所として使用されてるの。"

msgid "Lots of those squares are starting to show up on the streets..."
msgstr "四角形が、道路にまでたくさん現れ始めてね…"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed I know..."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed 知ってる…"

msgid "AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA!"
msgstr "あああああああああ！！！"

msgid "THE WORLD IS ENDING WHAT ARE WE GONNA DO"
msgstr "世界の終わりが近づいてきている！！\nいったいどうすれば！！！"

msgid "@niko Um..."
msgstr "@niko あの…"

msgid "@niko_wtf What... are you doing... to that book?"
msgstr "@niko_wtf その本に…何を…してるの？"

msgid "Editing it!!!"
msgstr "編集してんだよ！！"

msgid "I've been in the Author's shadow for my entire career."
msgstr "俺は作家として、ずっと「作者」の影に\n隠れてたんだ。"

msgid "If I'm gonna die soon, I wanna die knowing I put out at least ONE original idea out there!"
msgstr "もうすぐ死ぬっていうんなら、せめて1つぐらい、\n俺にしか思いつかないアイデアを\n世に出しておきたいだろ！"

msgid "Despite all this...\\.\\. I still really wish I could've met the Author..."
msgstr "まあ何だかんだ言ったけどさ…\\.\\.「作者」には、\n一度でいいから会ってみたかったな…"

msgid "@niko It's an ink bottle, complete with a quill."
msgstr "@niko 羽ペン付きのインクボトルだ。"

msgid "@niko_83c Brings back memories, doesn't it, \\p?"
msgstr "@niko_83c いろいろ思い出すね、 \\p？"

msgid "Reading helps me get my mind off things..."
msgstr "読書していると、余計なことを考えずに済む…"

msgid "At least THAT's finally off my bucket list..."
msgstr "夢が1つ叶ったぜ…"

msgid "...y'know, I finally saw the Author today!"
msgstr "…今日、ついに「作者」を見かけたんだ！"

msgid "Well, his flying machine, at least!"
msgstr "まあ、厳密には彼の空飛ぶ機械をな！"

msgid "I was looking out one of the windows in the library and spotted it in the distance with my binoculars!"
msgstr "図書館の窓から双眼鏡で覗いてたら、\n遠くで発見したんだぜ！"

msgid "Isn't that cool, messiah?"
msgstr "どうだ救世主、めっちゃスゴイだろ？"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed Yeah..."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed うん…"

msgid "@niko_speak Oh! Um..."
msgstr "@niko_speak あっ！あの…"

msgid "@niko2 What book did Cedric take?"
msgstr "@niko2 セドリックは、何て本を持っていったの？"

msgid "@george1_hm \"The Creation of Prophetbot\", one of the Author's greatest works in my opinion."
msgstr "@george1_hm 「預言者ロボの創造」よ。私に言わせれば、\n「作者」が執筆した本の中でも\n屈指の作品だわ。"

msgid "@george1 It's filled to the brim with intricate illustrations and blueprints... \\>\\n\\@george1_smile Lots of attention to detail, for sure."
msgstr "@george1 複雑な絵や設計図で溢れかえっていて… \\>\\n\\@george1_smile 随所に細部へのこだわりが見て取れるの。"

msgid "@george1_hm George rates it 10 out of 10."
msgstr "@george1_hm ジョージ・レビューでは、\n10点中10点というところかしら。"

msgid "@niko2 Ooh..."
msgstr "@niko2 へええ…"

msgid "@george2_stress One of my favorites, thank you very much..."
msgstr "@george2_stress お気に入りの一つなの、ありがとね…"

msgid "@george2_sigh ...it's the Author's book detailing the creation of Prophetbot."
msgstr "@george2_sigh …これは預言者ロボの制作を詳細に記した、\n作者の本なの。"

msgid "@george2 And by \"detailing\", I mean it! \\>\\n\\@george2_sigh There's a TON of detail in that book."
msgstr "@george2 ここでいう「詳細」ってのは、ホントに\n細っっっかくって意味だからね！ \\>\\n\\@george2_sigh とにかく本当に、細部まで書かれているの。"

msgid "@george2_grr Blueprints, progress shots..."
msgstr "@george2_grr 設計図やら、制作過程の写真やら…"

msgid "@george2_sigh Took me forever to edit..."
msgstr "@george2_sigh 編集にも死ぬほど時間かかったんだから…"

msgid "@george3_sad ...the Author's book on the creation of Prophetbot..."
msgstr "@george3_sad …預言者ロボの創造に関する、「作者」の本…"

msgid "@george3_sigh ...you know...\\.\\. the first robot you met in our world..."
msgstr "@george3_sigh …そう…\\.\\. あなたがこの世界で、最初に出会った\nロボットのこと…"

msgid "@niko2 Yeah."
msgstr "@niko2 うん。"

msgid "@george3_worry ...oh...\\.\\. The book was quite detailed, too...."
msgstr "@george3_worry …あぁ…\\.\\.あの本も、\nかなり詳細に書かれていたわね…"

msgid "@george3_sigh It...\\.\\. would've been useful to your friend, I think..."
msgstr "@george3_sigh きっと…\\.\\. あなたのお友達にも、\n役に立ってるわ…"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed ...yeah."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed …そうだね。"

msgid "@george4 The Author's book on the creation of Prophetbot!"
msgstr "@george4 預言者ロボの創造について書いた\n「作者」の本だよ！"

msgid "@george4_golly Remember Prophetbot? \\.\\.The first robot you met in our world?"
msgstr "@george4_golly 預言者ロボって覚えてる？ \\.\\.この世界で、キミが\n初めて出会ったロボットのこと！"

msgid "@george4_omg He's a work of art!!!"
msgstr "@george4_omg カレって、まさしく芸術作品だよね！"

msgid "@george4_smile The Author's book was so detailed... \\.\\.really made me appreciate how much work went into him!"
msgstr "@george4_smile 「作者」の本に、とっても細かく書かれてて… \\.\\.\nあのロボットにどれだけの熱意を\n注いでたのか、すっごく伝わってきんだ！"

msgid "@george5_hmm \"The Creation of Prophetbot\", dear.\\>\\n\\@george5_heh It's one of my favorite books by the Author!"
msgstr "@george5_hmm 「預言者ロボの創造」ね。\\>\\n\\@george5_heh 「作者」の本で、一番のお気に入りなのよ！"

msgid "@george5_hmm The book contains many detailed blueprints and progress shots."
msgstr "@george5_hmm この本には、細かく記した設計図と、制作過程の\n写真がたくさん掲載されているの。"

msgid "@george5_smile I really enjoyed editing it!"
msgstr "@george5_smile 編集作業をしていて、本当に楽しかったわ！"

msgid "@george6_point You remember Prophetbot? \\>\\n\\@george6 The first robot you met in our world?"
msgstr "@george6_point 預言者ロボってヤツ覚えてるー？ \\>\\n\\@george6 この世界で、Youが最初に会ったロボットのこと！"

msgid "@niko ...yeah?"
msgstr "@niko …うん。"

msgid "@george6_smile The Author wrote a book on how he was made!\\>\\n\\@george6_shrug It's one of his best works, bruh."
msgstr "@george6_smile そのロボをどうやって\n作ったかっつー「作者」の本なのヨ！\\>\\n\\@george6_shrug マジ、チョー最高傑作。"

msgid "@george6 You just gotta love that guy's attention to detail... all the little parts that just came together..."
msgstr "@george6 アイツのこだわり、ホントヤバイよ…\nどこを読んでも感動、みたいな…"

msgid "@george6_point ...was the freshest book I've ever edited, man!"
msgstr "@george6_point …ウチが編集やってきて、いっちばん\nクールな本だったわ！"

msgid "@niko A small pile of books."
msgstr "@niko 小さく積まれた本。"

msgid "[HELLO, PERSON.]"
msgstr "[どうモ、人間。]"

msgid "[THIS IS THE LIBRARY / TEMPORARY SHELTER.]"
msgstr "[ここハ、図書館 兼 一時避難所でス。]"

msgid "[DO YOU NEED SOMETHING? PLEASE APPROACH FROM THE FRONT.]"
msgstr "[何カ必要なのですカ？\n正面ニ来てくださイ。]"

msgid "@bookbot [THE ARCHIVAL ROOM IS CURRENTLY BEING USED AS AN INFIRMARY.]"
msgstr "@bookbot [収蔵庫ハ現在、医務室として\n使用されていまス。]"

msgid "@bookbot [WE APOLOGIZE FOR THE INCONVENIENCE.]"
msgstr "@bookbot [ご不便ヲおかけして、\n申し訳ございませン。]"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed It's okay..."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed 大丈夫…"

msgid "@niko A computer. It's currently off."
msgstr "@niko コンピューターだ。今は電源が切れてる。"

msgid "Everyone here should be safe for now..."
msgstr "ひとまず、ここにいればみんな平気よ…"

msgid "This library was built fairly recently, you know..."
msgstr "この図書館は、かなり最近に建てられたものなのよ…"

msgid "Shortly after the first squares appeared, they wanted to build something that could withstand partial collapse."
msgstr "四角形が初めて出現した後すぐに、人々は\n局所的な崩壊に耐えられるような建物を\n作ろうとした。"

msgid "The architects used the newest, strongest materials they had."
msgstr "建築家は、当時の最新かつ\n最高強度を誇る材料を使用したの。"

msgid "...Thank goodness for that."
msgstr "…そのことに感謝ね。"

msgid "I hope the Author is safe..."
msgstr "「作者」は無事だといいけど…"

msgid "I wonder where the Author is..."
msgstr "「作者」は今どこにいるんだろうか…"

msgid "Apparently he just kinda... stopped showing up."
msgstr "急に…姿を全く見せなくなったみたいでね。"

msgid "The head librarian says she's still getting his manuscripts, but..."
msgstr "図書館長が言うには、「作者」の原稿は\nまだ送られてきているらしいけど…"

msgid "No one has seen him in person in so long..."
msgstr "直接見たことのある人なんて、もうずっといない…"

msgid "@niko2 ..."
msgstr "@niko2 …"

msgid "....sigh."
msgstr "…はぁ。"

msgid "Many people have been assuming the worst."
msgstr "みんな、最悪の結果を想像してる。"

msgid "I hope my friends are okay!"
msgstr "ぼくの友達、みんな無事だといいな！"

msgid "Another group of evacuees should be arriving soon..."
msgstr "他の避難者たちが、もうすぐやってくるはず…"

msgid "@niko Books are neatly placed on the shelf."
msgstr "@niko 本が棚にきちんとに並んでる。"

msgid "@niko Books are placed neatly on the shelf."
msgstr "@niko 本がきちんと棚に並んでる。"

msgid "@niko Placed books are neatly on the shelf."
msgstr "@niko 並べられた本がきちんと棚にある。"

msgid "@niko On the shelf are neatly placed books."
msgstr "@niko 棚にはきちんと並べられた本がある。"

msgid "@niko Neatly placed books are on the shelf."
msgstr "@niko きちんと並べられた本が棚にある。"

msgid "@niko On the shelf neatly are placed books."
msgstr "@niko きちんと棚には並べられた本がある。"

msgid "@niko Placed books are on the shelf neatly."
msgstr "@niko 並べられた本が棚にきちんとある。"

msgid "@niko Books are on the shelf, neatly placed."
msgstr "@niko 本が棚にあって、きちんと並べられてる。"

msgid "@niko A pile of books on the ground."
msgstr "@niko 本が床に山積みになってる。"

msgid "@kip_pout Please be careful out there..."
msgstr "@kip_pout 気をつけてね…"

msgid "@niko A book!"
msgstr "@niko 本だ！"

msgid "Sigh...."
msgstr "はぁ…"

msgid "I had to leave my aquarium behind when they were sounding the sirens earlier..."
msgstr "さっきサイレンが鳴ってね。水槽は\n置いていくしかなかった…"

msgid "I wish I had time to rescue my fish..."
msgstr "あの子たちを助けにいく時間があれば…"

msgid "[RESHELVING IN PROGRESS...]"
msgstr "[本ヲ棚に戻していまス…]"

msgid "Well, it was nice knowing y'all I suppose..."
msgstr "ま、そうさね。\nあんたらに会えて、よかったよ…"

msgid "When the world ends, would it be better if it was gone in an instant, or slowly fading away?"
msgstr "世界が滅びるなら、パッと消えてなくなるか、\nそれとも、ジワジワと滅びていくか…\n…あんたなら、どっちを選ぶかね？"

msgid "Haha... looks like we're stuck with the latter."
msgstr "ヒヒ…あたしらには後者しか残されてないがね。"

msgid "@niko A tall pile of books."
msgstr "@niko 高く山積みされた本。"

msgid "@niko Hi."
msgstr "@niko やあ。"

msgid "[RESHELVING IN PROGRESS.]"
msgstr "[本ヲ棚に戻していまス。]"

msgid "[PLEASE WATCH OUT FOR POTENTIAL FALLING BOOKS.]"
msgstr "[本の落下ニご注意くださイ。]"

msgid "@niko_speak I will!"
msgstr "@niko_speak 分かった！"

msgid "I won't lose hope."
msgstr "でも希望は捨てないことにしよう。"

msgid "Sigh..."
msgstr "はぁ…"

msgid "It's comforting to see the faith you have in \\p, messiah..."
msgstr "君の \\p に対する信念を見ていると、\nこっちも安心するよ、救世主さま…"

msgid "That's why... I won't lose hope either."
msgstr "おかげで…僕も希望を抱いていられる。"

msgid "@niko Coffee cups."
msgstr "@niko コーヒーカップだ。"

msgid "@niko_speak Coffee is for grown-ups!"
msgstr "@niko_speak コーヒーは大人の飲み物だよね！"

msgid "HEY IM GIR I MADE AN EVENT DOOT DOOT MOTHER FUCKER"
msgstr "HEY IM GIR I MADE AN EVENT DOOT DOOT MOTHER FUCKER"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed Yup... still scared of ladders."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed うん…まだハシゴは怖いや。"

msgid "Y'know, now that everyone's coming to me for help..."
msgstr "助けてくれー！って\nよく頼られるようになってさ、その…"

msgid "...it really makes me appreciate you more, messiah!"
msgstr "…あんたには改めて感謝しなきゃな、救世主！"

msgid "Thank you for all you've done for us."
msgstr "俺たちのために、今まで\n頑張ってくれてありがとな。"

msgid "Looks like my life's work is finally being put to good use!"
msgstr "ついに、俺の人生をかけた商品が役に立つ\n日が来たようだな！"

msgid "As long as we conserve the water we have on hand..."
msgstr "残された水を節約していけば…"

msgid "...my water pills should be able to keep everyone here from going thirsty for weeks!"
msgstr "…このカプセルさえあれば、ここにいる住民が\n脱水症状になっちまうことはない！"

msgid "@niko A coffee machine."
msgstr "@niko コーヒーを作る機械。"

msgid "@niko It's almost empty..."
msgstr "@niko ほとんど空っぽだ…"

msgid "@niko This stand smells... sugary."
msgstr "@niko この屋台…甘い匂いがする。"

msgid "Candy skewers, fresh off the grill!"
msgstr "キャンディーの串焼き、焼き立てですよー！"

msgid "...Not very nutritious, I'm afraid."
msgstr "…あんまり栄養はないけど、ね。"

msgid "But at least they'll keep the evacuees from gettin' hungry!"
msgstr "でもしばらくの間、避難者たちの\n空腹は満たせるはず！"

msgid "@niko A photo of some plants."
msgstr "@niko 植物の写真。"

msgid "The city gate was destroyed a while back, I can't go into the Glen anymore..."
msgstr "少し前に街のゲートが壊れてさ、もう峡谷には\n行けなくなっちまった…"

msgid "I'm not sure where I'll be able to get my supply of fish, at this rate..."
msgstr "これから、どこで魚を確保すりゃいいのかな…"

msgid "@niko Some sort of plaque."
msgstr "@niko 何かの飾り版。"

msgid "I still have plenty of these soup dumplings left!"
msgstr "まだ小籠包は沢山あるぞ！"

msgid "Looks like it should feed everyone here for at least another day."
msgstr "この量なら、あと一日はもつだろう。"

msgid "@niko_what2 (This guy scares me, \\p...!)"
msgstr "@niko_what2 （この男の人、すっごく恐いよ、\n\\p…！）"

msgid "..."
msgstr "…"

msgid "....WHAT!? You need something?!"
msgstr "…何だ！？用でもあんのか！？"

msgid "@niko_huh No...?"
msgstr "@niko_huh ないよ…？"

msgid "Suit yourself."
msgstr "なら好きにしな。"

msgid "BUT, just so that you know."
msgstr "だが、言っておくけどな。"

msgid "Due to recent events, the restriction on noise levels in the library has been temporarily lifted."
msgstr "最近色々あったせいで、図書館の騒音制限が\n一時的に解除されたんだよ。"

msgid "...So I WON'T be kicking people out like before."
msgstr "…だから別に、前みたいに\n人を追い出したりしねえよ。"

msgid "@niko_what Um..."
msgstr "@niko_what あの…"

msgid "....WHAT???"
msgstr "…ああ？？"

msgid "You think I'm gonna be throwing out the evacuees just cuz I'm a delinquent stuck doing community service???"
msgstr "社会奉仕させられてる犯罪者だからっつって、\n俺が避難者を追い出すとでも思ってんのか？？？"

msgid "@niko_what ...No...?"
msgstr "@niko_what …ううん…？"

msgid "Good!!! Because I'm NOT!!!!!"
msgstr "ならいい！！ 俺はそんな奴じゃないからなあ！！！"

msgid "Looks like I'll have to cancel my appointment..."
msgstr "予約は全部キャンセルか…"

msgid "This stinks!"
msgstr "最悪だ！"

msgid "@niko A photo of some people."
msgstr "@niko 人の写真。"

msgid "[EVENING NEWS! EVENING NEWS!]"
msgstr "[夕刊でス！夕刊でス！]"

msgid "[EVERYTHING IS TERRIBLE]"
msgstr "[何もかもガ、大変なことになっていまス。]"

msgid "@bookbot [IF YOU HAVE AN INQUIRY. PLEASE APPROACH FROM THE FRONT.]"
msgstr "@bookbot [何かご質問ですカ。\n正面に来てくださイ。]"

msgid "@niko I'm good, thanks!"
msgstr "@niko 大丈夫、ありがとう！"

msgid "@kelvin [The world is going to be much colder soon.]"
msgstr "@kelvin [世界はもうすぐ、もっと寒くなる。]"

msgid "@kelvin [At least... I can keep everyone here warm.]"
msgstr "@kelvin [ここなら… 私が\n皆を暖めてあげられる。]"

msgid "@niko Looks like a list of book titles written here..."
msgstr "@niko 本のタイトル一覧が\nここに書かれているみたい…"

msgid "ZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZ"
msgstr "ZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZ"

msgid "@niko_speak A big book with a black clover on the cover."
msgstr "@niko_speak 表紙に黒いクローバーが描かれた大きな本。"

msgid "@niko The title says \"A Comprehensive Guide to Phosphors\"."
msgstr "@niko タイトルは「蛍光体の総合ガイド」だって。"

msgid "@niko A marker drawing of a clover."
msgstr "@niko マーカーで描かれたクローバーの絵。"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed She's asleep..."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed 寝てるみたい…"

msgid "*yawn*"
msgstr "ふわぁ…"

msgid "The lab complex got totaled, didn't it...."
msgstr "研究施設はほぼ全壊みたいね…"

msgid "@niko3 Yeah..."
msgstr "@niko3 うん…"

msgid "All those hours I put into my work, and now..."
msgstr "仕事にあれだけ時間を費やしたのに…今は…"

msgid "now...."
msgstr "今はもう…"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed She fell asleep..."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed 寝ちゃった…"

msgid "@niko A marker eraser."
msgstr "@niko ホワイトボード消し。"

msgid "@niko The title says \"Emergence of New Ecological Niches In A Post-Sun World\"."
msgstr "@niko タイトルは「太陽消滅後の世界における、\n新しい生態的地位の出現」だって。"

msgid "Monitoring... monitoring..."
msgstr "監視中…監視中…"

msgid "Looks like our scouting unit #A27 is still doing okay..."
msgstr "偵察ユニット#A27はまだ無事のようだ…"

msgid "@niko A green marker."
msgstr "@niko 緑色のマーカー。"

msgid "kip card"
msgstr "キップのカード"

msgid "Robots are the only ones that we can send out there, now..."
msgstr "あの場所に送り出せるのは、もはや\nロボットだけなのだよ…"

msgid "Thankfully, we still have a couple of units that aren't too badly damaged..."
msgstr "だが幸運にも、損傷の軽いユニットが\nまだいくつかある…"

msgid "This little guy ran into some squares earlier and managed to escape mostly intact."
msgstr "先ほど、この小さいのが四角形に遭遇したのだが、\nほとんど無傷で脱出したのだよ。"

msgid "These newer models are pretty tough!"
msgstr "最新モデルはなかなか頑丈だな！"

msgid "I just like looking at pictures."
msgstr "絵を見るのが好きなんだ。"

msgid "@niko_speak You're going through these pages pretty fast!"
msgstr "@niko_speak 読むのがすごく早いね！"

msgid "Actually, it's mostly pictures!"
msgstr "だって、ほとんど絵だもん！"

msgid "The Author is an artist too, y'know!"
msgstr "「作者」は芸術家でもあるんだよ！"

msgid "@niko_eyeclosed I could tell, yeah..."
msgstr "@niko_eyeclosed それは知ってる、うん…"

msgid "@niko A blue marker."
msgstr "@niko 青色のマーカー。"

msgid "niko card"
msgstr "ニコのカード"

msgid "@niko A red marker."
msgstr "@niko 赤色のマーカー。"

msgid "glittery"
msgstr "キラキラ光る"

msgid "His books are the only things keeping me going in these trying times."
msgstr "彼の本があるから、僕はこのような試練も\n乗り越えることができている。"

msgid "With the world being the way it is now..."
msgstr "世界がこのような状態になってしまった今…"

msgid "I'm just glad The Author was able to write down all this stuff before everything went off the rails."
msgstr "全てがおかしくなってしまう前に、\n「作者」がこれだけのことを書き留めておいて\nくれて、本当に良かったよ。"

msgid "I NEED TO FIND OUT HOW THIS BOOK ENDS..."
msgstr "この本がどんな結末を迎えるのか、\nどうしても知りたいんだよ…"

msgid "@niko2 Ummm...."
msgstr "@niko2 うーん…"

msgid "IF I DIE I WANNA DIE READING!"
msgstr "死ぬ時は、本を読みながら死んでやるぜ！！"

msgid "@niko This dry erase board is made of metal."
msgstr "@niko このホワイトボードは金属製だね。"

msgid "cardquest + desk"
msgstr "カードクエスト + デスク"

